Scope: this licence covers the scripts, recipes, documentation and result files
written for this repository. The files under patches/ are changes to llama.cpp
(MIT, (c) the ggml authors) and are offered under the same MIT terms as the
project they modify; patches/c2-dsml-parser.patch also adds a copy of the
DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash chat template taken from the model's GGUF metadata, which
remains under the model's own licence. Model weights referred to here are not
included and keep their own licences; in particular the DFlash2 drafter
(Anbeeld/GLM-5.3-Flash-DFlash2-GGUF) is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.
